story:
At the height of the Apex Global summit, the elite guests gathered at the lavish mansion of the host, Mr. Victor Blackwood. The opulent venue served an exquisite dinner prepared by the renowned chef, Monsieur Leon. The atmosphere was tense, as the attendees were discussing groundbreaking business ventures and rivalries. Suddenly, the room fell into chaos as the guests began gasping for breath.

The victim, Dr. Amelia Kim, the renowned biochemist from the summit, staggered and collapsed, succumbing to an unidentified toxin. The setting: A lavish mansion, filled with well-dressed tycoons and politicians. The timeline: The poisoning occurred after the dessert course. Here are the testimonies of the four suspects.

